    `the date it began`                                                        IS A DATE
    `where it arose`                                                           IS A `A country group`
    `dates on which it was treated before`                                     IS A LIST OF DATE
    `the date the insured person first knew of its symptoms or of the illness` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `its marks`                                                                IS A LIST OF `A mark of a chronic illness`
    `a competent authority has given a clear conclusion on the pathology`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the direct cause of the death or the disablement`                         IS A BOOLEAN

