    `examination`
    `a check-up`
    `hiring a nurse`
    `an ambulance of a hospital, of a lawful clinic, or of the 115 service`
    `a taxi`
    `transport from a lower-level to a higher-level hospital in Vietnam`
    -- optional benefit 2
    `examination fee`
