    `food`
    `personal items`
    `medicine to treat an illness`
    `screening`
    -- anything else
    `a head of cost the Rules do not name`

-- The programmes whose main limits definition 12 speaks of.
DECLARE `A programme` IS ONE OF
    `Programme I`
    `Programme II`

§§ `Claim items, limits and running totals`

-- One line of a claim: one benefit, one head of cost, one amount, one date.
-- `the date`: the day the cost was incurred, or the day of the death, or the day the
--   disablement is established; for a cost of a hospital stay, the day of admission.
-- `the amount charged`: what the bill says. `the reasonable and customary amount`: the part
--   of it within the general level of comparable establishments in the area (definition 35),
--   as the assessor states it.
-- `the visit`: which outpatient visit the item belongs to (optional benefit 2 has a limit per
--   visit); 0 for any other item.
-- `the main benefit it belongs to`: for transport, which of benefits 1-3 it goes with, since
--   transport is "within the limits of main benefits 1, 2 and 3".
-- src:188 | 35. Chi phí hợp lý
-- src:189 | Là các chi phí không vượt quá mức chi phí chung của các cơ sở y tế có cùng điều kiện trong khu vực khi cung cấp các dịch vụ
-- src:190 | điều trị tương đương hoặc mức độ điều trị đối với bệnh hoặc thương tật do tai nạn tương tự.
-- src:331 | Quyền lợi chi phí vận chuyển bao gồm trong giới hạn của quyền lợi chính 1, 2 và 3.
DECLARE `A claim item` HAS
    `the benefit`                                                       IS A `A benefit`
    `the head of cost`                                                  IS A `A head of cost`
    `the date`                                                          IS A DATE
    `the amount charged`                                                IS A NUMBER
    `the reasonable and customary amount`                               IS A NUMBER
    `the treatments it involves`                                        IS A LIST OF `A treatment named in the Rules`
    `the order`                                                         IS A MAYBE `The doctor who gave the order`
    `given during the hospital stay`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the place of treatment`                                            IS A `The place of treatment`
    `directly related to the illness or injury for which the insured person was then admitted` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insured person was in a critical condition threatening life and needing emergency treatment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the main benefit it belongs to`                                    IS A MAYBE `A benefit`
    `the visit`                                                         IS A NUMBER
    `a visit to one specialty of one medical establishment, with tests or diagnostics, a specific diagnosis and a doctor's order for treatment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the prescription was paid once already`                            IS A BOOLEAN

-- A limit that payments are counted against.
DECLARE `A limit` IS ONE OF
    `the limit for`      HAS `the benefit`   IS A `A benefit`
    `the main limit of`  HAS `the programme` IS A `A programme`
    `the limit for visit` HAS `the visit`    IS A NUMBER

-- An amount already counted against a limit in the period of insurance.
DECLARE `An amount counted against a limit` HAS
    `the limit`   IS A `A limit`
    `the amount`  IS A NUMBER

-- A limit that applies to an item, and how large it is for this policy.
DECLARE `A limit that applies` HAS
    `the limit`   IS A `A limit`
    `its size`    IS A NUMBER

-- Part 4 clause 6: other insurance that covers the same medical expenses.
-- `the amount the other insurance pays`: what the other insurers pay for the same costs.
-- `the limits of all the insurances, in total`: the denominator of the clause's ratio.
-- src:597 | 6. Đồng bảo hiểm/các Đơn bảo hiểm giống nhau
-- src:598 | Trong trường hợp chi phí y tế liên quan tới cùng thương tật, bệnh tật được bảo hiểm theo Quy tắc này có thể đòi bồi thường từ
-- src:599 | những loại hình bảo hiểm khác, PTI chỉ thanh toán khoản tiền vượt quá mức được bồi thường theo các Quy tắc bảo hiểm khác
-- src:600 | đó hoặc theo tỷ lệ giữa số tiền bảo hiểm của Quy tắc bảo hiểm này với tổng giới hạn trách nhiệm của tất cả Quy tắc bảo hiểm.
DECLARE `Other insurance` HAS
    `the amount the other insurance pays`          IS A NUMBER
    `the limits of all the insurances, in total`   IS A NUMBER

