DECLARE `A claim document` IS ONE OF
    `an accident report certified by the employer`
    `an accident report by the insured person or the beneficiary`
    `an accident record certified by the police or the local authority`
    `an accident record`
    `a copy of both sides of the driving licence and the vehicle registration`
    `the medical record book or examination slip`
    `the doctor's orders for tests, ultrasound or X-ray, and their results`
    `receipts or invoices for imaging, tests and ultrasound, itemised by kind of cost`
    `an itemised statement, where an invoice gives only a total`
    `the prescription`
